---
import type { CollectionEntry } from 'astro:content';
import { articlePath, categoryPath, topicGuides, mediaInfo } from '../lib/ltori-media.mjs';
interface Props { posts: CollectionEntry<'recruitment'>[] }
const { posts } = Astro.props;
const firstReads = topicGuides.map(guide => posts.find(post => post.id === guide.startId) ?? posts.find(post=>post.data.category===guide.category)).filter(Boolean);
---
<aside class="lm-sidebar" aria-label="記事の読み方とカテゴリー">
  {firstReads.length > 0 && <section class="lm-side-box"><h2>最初に読みたい記事</h2><ol class="lm-first-reads">{firstReads.map((post,index)=><li><span aria-hidden="true">{index+1}</span><a href={articlePath(post.id)}>{post.data.title}</a></li>)}</ol><p class="lm-side-caption">編集部が選んだ、課題別の入口です。</p></section>}
  <section class="lm-side-box"><h2>カテゴリーから探す</h2><ul class="lm-category-list">{topicGuides.map(guide=><li><a href={categoryPath(guide.slug)}>#{guide.category}<span>{posts.filter(post=>post.data.category===guide.category).length}</span></a></li>)}</ul></section>
  <section class="lm-side-about"><p class="lm-kicker">{mediaInfo.name}</p><h2>このメディアについて</h2><p>採用LINEの活用を、日々の採用業務に役立つ知識に。</p><a class="lm-text-link" href={mediaInfo.aboutPath}>編集方針・運営会社 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="lm-button lm-button-secondary" href={mediaInfo.contactPath}>お問い合わせ <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section>
</aside>
